      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After looking into this more it seems to have to do with tiling and offset, with it being most notable while setting the offset values of certain textures to very high numbers, like 100. \n\nNotice the pixelation increase as the images change between an X offset of 0, 10, and 100\n\nThis example is using the detail albedo but after testing every texture. map, and mask, the problem only occurs with:\n\n-Emissions Map\n\n-Detail Texture\n\n-Detail Normal Map",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
