      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some testing, I think this might be a mediump shader precision issue as PC uploads aren't affected. Toon Standard really ought to use fullp here, as detail textures are often tiled *very, very* finely across large atlases. A fix would be greatly appreciated -- aggresive tiling can provide us huge VRAM savings ^^",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
